<title>HONG KONG: HK Oct provisional trade deficit HK$8.2 bln.</title>
<headline>HK Oct provisional trade deficit HK$8.2 bln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department released the following data showing a provisional visible trade deficit of HK$8.2 billion in October (rounded figures in billions of H.K. dollars):</p>
<p>			    Oct '96	Sept '96	Oct '95</p>
<p> Trade balance	  -8.2	   -4.60	   -8.34</p>
<p> Domestic Exports     19.4	   18.26	   20.79</p>
<p> Re-exports	    110.5	  107.83	  102.14</p>
<p> Total exports	 129.9	  126.09	  122.92</p>
<p> Imports		 138.1	  130.69	  131.26</p>
<p>Cumulative figures for year-ended -</p>
<p>			   Oct '96	Sept '96	 Oct '95</p>
<p> Trade balance	 -134.97	 -135.11	  -141.66</p>
<p> Domestic Exports     214.93	  216.29	   233.23</p>
<p> Re-exports	   1,175.89	1,167.55	 1,092.31</p>
<p> Total exports	1,390.83	1,383.84	 1,325.54</p>
<p> Imports		1,525.80	1,518.95	 1,467.20</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
